@host = http://localhost:5114
@projectId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000001
@token = replace-with-raw-access-token

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Sync (pull) — send the SyncId the client currently holds
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/sync
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "syncId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Push — send the pending LocEntryChange list
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/push
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "syncId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "changes": [
    {
      "type": "TagAdded",
      "entryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "entrySubId": "",
      "changeData": "example-tag",
      "prevSourceHashData": "",
      "prevDestHashData": ""
    }
  ]
}
